{
  "id": "qd_ppms_dynacool",
  "manufacturer": "Quantum Design",
  "model": "PPMS DynaCool",
  "family": "cryogen-free physical property measurement platform",
  "description": "Cryogen-free Physical Property Measurement System using a single two-stage pulse tube cryocooler; 1.8-400 K base system with one of three conduction-cooled superconducting magnets (9 T, 12 T or 14 T) and a 12-pin puck-based open-architecture sample chamber (2.5 cm clear bore). Measurement options (ETO, DC resistivity, VSM, heat capacity, ACMS II, TTO, He-3, DR, etc.) are separately ordered add-ons. Values below are manufacturer specifications from qdusa.com brochures 1307-010 Rev. G0 and 1084-500 Rev. J0 plus the QD user manual 1307-110 Rev. D1.",
